# Shared remote rule set
# Hard REJECT: domestic Claude relay + browser WebRTC STUN.
# Keep DOMAIN-only so Quantumult X / Shadowrocket can parse it.
# Game-host STUN (stun.qq.com / nintendo / xbox) stays in client fake-ip-filter, not here.
# Google STUN ports 19302/19305 are rejected in Clash YAML/JS, not here.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,huanling.icu

# Chrome / Firefox / Safari leak tests. stun1-4 are siblings, not subdomains of stun.l.google.com.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,stun.l.google.com
DOMAIN,stun1.l.google.com
DOMAIN,stun2.l.google.com
DOMAIN,stun3.l.google.com
DOMAIN,stun4.l.google.com
